claim.claim-text:
a photoelectric conversion section configured to perform photoelectric conversion;
a first capacitor configured to hold a first signal from the photoelectric conversion section;
a second capacitor configured to hold a second signal from the photoelectric conversion section;
a first reading section that reads the first signal held in the first capacitor;
a second reading section that reads the second signal held in the second capacitor;
a differential circuit in which the first signal from the first reading section is input at one end and the second signal from the second reading section is input at another end;
an initialization section configured to initialize the differential circuit; and wherein the photoelectric conversion circuit is included in a first substrate, and the first capacitor and the second capacitor are included in a second substrate.
